                                                "sense_id": "e31f87bc-502b-35e5-ad88-32c2fb235e57",
                                                "text": "Whatever the mode of origin, buddings from a particular bud-parent have been found to agree in habit and general characteristics, while all buddings develop similar features which distinguish them from seedling trees."
